  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can charge your melee weapon with ki, giving it additional damage potential.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Str 13, Wis 13, Weapon Focus.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your attack with a melee weapon deals an extra +1 point of damage per ki point invested in this chakra.</p>\n<p>By expending your ki focus and attacking with a melee weapon with which you have the Weapon Focus feat, your attack deals an extra +1d6 points of damage per invested ki point expended. You must decide to expend your ki focus with this feat prior to making an attack. If your attack misses, you still expend your ki focus and any ki points.</p>\n<p>You gain one point of ki.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc45\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
